title: "GNAFOR Field Collector — Mobile-first web application for systematic field data collection in tropical forage grass experiments"
authors:
  - family-names: Pereira
    given-names: Vinícius Valim
    affiliation: "Universidade do Estado de Minas Gerais (UEMG) — Unidade Divinópolis"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/[SEU-ORCID]"
abstract: "Single-file, offline-capable web application (HTML5/CSS3/JavaScript) for systematic field data collection in tropical forage grass experiments. Four integrated modules (leaf morphogenesis, tillering, dry mass production, canopy height) with client-side validation, GPS tagging, bilingual PT/EN interface, localStorage capacity management, and real-time Google Sheets synchronization."
